<title>NEW ZEALAND: Newmarket Property first half profit flat.</title>
<headline>Newmarket Property first half profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to Dec 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    2.27 vs 2.23</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   3.43 vs 3.38</p>
<p>    Turnover				6.48 vs 4.69</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 3.14 vs 3.14</p>
<p>    Tax				     0.87 vs 0.91</p>
<p>    Units outstanding (million)     66.0 vs same</p>
<p>Note -  Newmarket Property Trust Ltd is a property company.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
